@* Stands in for MainLayout: the editor projects the validation panel, the navigator, and the
   inspector into the dock outlet, which only renders when an outlet with the same identity is
   present. The aside carries the layout's class so a test can tell dock content from main content. *@
<StoryEditor />
<aside class="app-dock">
    <SectionOutlet SectionId="LayoutSections.Dock" />
</aside>
